{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14782","headline":"送史兵曹判官赴楼烦 · 卢纶","name":"送史兵曹判官赴楼烦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渥洼龙种散云时，千里繁花乍别离。\n中有重臣承霈泽，外无轻虏犯旌旗。\n山川自与郊垧合，帐幕时因水草移。\n敢谢亲贤得琼玉，仲宣能赋亦能诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14782.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14782","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}